{"3910020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Calamity", "steam_appid": 3910020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/cb42c9f67a67e9c01485bcfda50c0319.poster.avif?t=1773219573\" width=1600 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/cb42c9f67a67e9c01485bcfda50c0319.webm?t=1773219573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Calamity, a free-to-play sandbox MMORPG set in a vibrant 2D top-down world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre legends such as World of Warcraft, Lineage, Diablo, and Albion Online, Calamity invites you to conquer challenging dungeons, team up with friends, and shape a true player-driven economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With flexible weapon-based classes, deep itemization, and three-player online co-op, every adventurer will find a unique path in this captivating fantasy realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/10e53993ce73e2f4b2dc2b6a985aa49e.webp?t=1773219573\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/10e53993ce73e2f4b2dc2b6a985aa49e.poster.avif?t=1773219573\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1600 height=336 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you earn through skill and dedication can be traded on the in-game marketplace, keeping loot circulation firmly in players’ hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/ff722c2f4897da07ba7705e67356e82f.poster.avif?t=1773219573\" width=1600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/ff722c2f4897da07ba7705e67356e82f.webm?t=1773219573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-target abilities lock to your chosen foe, while directional and area-of-effect skills demand careful aim. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specializations</strong> – Warrior, Archer, and Mage at launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Skills</strong> – Each weapon can carry up to four active abilities; reroll specific skills at a dedicated NPC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor Skills</strong> – Upgrading to higher-tier armor unlocks new active and passive abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/e65d50f292aa1c750fbd45766e346827.avif?t=1773219573\" width=1600 height=309 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialization Levels</strong> – Level the weapon type you use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Rarities</strong> – Common → Epic gear with semi-randomized stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gem Sockets</strong> – Embed five gem types for min-max power; combine or extract at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhancement</strong> – Merge duplicates to push gear from +1 to +10. Attempts above +4 risk downgrades, adding tension to every upgrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Player Online Co-op</strong> – Tackle dungeons, world bosses, and seasonal raids with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Economy</strong> – Every loot drop is tradable; supply and demand—not cash—set prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Gear Presets</strong> – Instantly swap weapon sets and armor mixes for any encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Leaderboards</strong> – Compete for prestige titles and exclusive cosmetic skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Friendly Monetization</strong> – Optional subscription, convenience boosts, and cosmetic items.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/cb42c9f67a67e9c01485bcfda50c0319.poster.avif?t=1773219573\" width=1600 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/cb42c9f67a67e9c01485bcfda50c0319.webm?t=1773219573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Calamity, a free-to-play sandbox MMORPG set in a vibrant 2D top-down world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre legends such as World of Warcraft, Lineage, Diablo, and Albion Online, Calamity invites you to conquer challenging dungeons, team up with friends, and shape a true player-driven economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With flexible weapon-based classes, deep itemization, and three-player online co-op, every adventurer will find a unique path in this captivating fantasy realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/10e53993ce73e2f4b2dc2b6a985aa49e.webp?t=1773219573\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/10e53993ce73e2f4b2dc2b6a985aa49e.poster.avif?t=1773219573\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1600 height=336 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you earn through skill and dedication can be traded on the in-game marketplace, keeping loot circulation firmly in players’ hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/ff722c2f4897da07ba7705e67356e82f.poster.avif?t=1773219573\" width=1600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/ff722c2f4897da07ba7705e67356e82f.webm?t=1773219573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-target abilities lock to your chosen foe, while directional and area-of-effect skills demand careful aim. Easy to learn, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specializations</strong> – Warrior, Archer, and Mage at launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Skills</strong> – Each weapon can carry up to four active abilities; reroll specific skills at a dedicated NPC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor Skills</strong> – Upgrading to higher-tier armor unlocks new active and passive abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/extras/e65d50f292aa1c750fbd45766e346827.avif?t=1773219573\" width=1600 height=309 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialization Levels</strong> – Level the weapon type you use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Rarities</strong> – Common → Epic gear with semi-randomized stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gem Sockets</strong> – Embed five gem types for min-max power; combine or extract at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhancement</strong> – Merge duplicates to push gear from +1 to +10. Attempts above +4 risk downgrades, adding tension to every upgrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Player Online Co-op</strong> – Tackle dungeons, world bosses, and seasonal raids with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Economy</strong> – Every loot drop is tradable; supply and demand—not cash—set prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Gear Presets</strong> – Instantly swap weapon sets and armor mixes for any encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal Leaderboards</strong> – Compete for prestige titles and exclusive cosmetic skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-Friendly Monetization</strong> – Optional subscription, convenience boosts, and cosmetic items.</p>", "short_description": "An Action RPG with engaging classic gameplay you love. Conquer dungeons, challenge players, and gear up with epic loot in a world with a player-driven economy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/2c9435f0fd8349637b33706f6349503fe879b88f/header.jpg?t=1773219573", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/559575525842d69d57a488a2074fd07111f0ad9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773219573", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910020/559575525842d69d57a488a2074fd07111f0ad9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773219573", "website": "https://calamity.online/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 6